  test "a second trust root added by configuration alone turns the gate red" do
    # ⭐ A GATE YOU HAVE NEVER SEEN FAIL IS NOT KNOWN TO WORK. The falsifier boo
ts a whole Realm per
    # arm with a second root injected, and its strongest arm edits a TRACKED CON
FIG FILE and nothing
